                "text": "I\u2019m proud to #BacktheBlue. I voted for four pro-law enforcement bills this week:\n\u2705 Improving Law Enforcement Officer Safety and Wellness Through Data Act\n\u2705 LEOSA Reform Act\n\u2705 Federal Law Enforcement Officer Service Weapon Purchase Act\n\u2705 Resolution supporting local law enforcement officers led by my friend @RepEzell",
