                "text": "Today I had the chance to see Church & Dwight's operations firsthand & hear more about their production process. The animal nutrition products made right here in Mason City are utilized by farmers across the U.S. and around the world! Iowa manufacturing remains strong thanks to companies like this one investing in our workers and communities!",
